  "description": "Review a pull request against the defect classes this repo actually produces. One seat reads the whole diff and maps it; five seats each hunt ONE defect class over the slice they are pointed at; one seat attacks every finding, runs what can be run, and issues the verdict. The dimensions are CLAUDE.md's North Stars made into seats: reached, absence, cannot-fail, edge, chain. A finding must name the sabotage that would turn a law red, or it is filed as a question."
